{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15109140","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1510914001:0":{"text":"오르파가...","source_cn":"奥法迦……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4548E193DF825B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510914002:1":{"text":"어째서... 어째서 로르를 죽인 거지... 왜 평범한 인간을 상대로, 신의 힘까지 쓰는 것이냐!","source_cn":"为什么……为什么要杀了他……为什么要用神力对付凡人？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1887060D754993B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510914003:1":{"text":"저 자는 널 해치려고 했어!","source_cn":"他伤害了你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47ABD79A521FADF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510914004:0":{"text":"너에겐 부적이 있는데 왜 다친 거지? 돌아와, 내 곁으로... 내가 널 보호해 줄게.","source_cn":"有护身符的保护，你怎么会受到伤害？回来，回到我身边……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6015916D81E7AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510914005:0":{"text":"...내게 부적은 필요 없다.","source_cn":"……我不需要护身符了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CBF416CD771462F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510914006:0":{"text":"당신도 필요 없고.","source_cn":"也不需要你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE3CF693202FB56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510914007:0":{"text":"페르세우스... 네가...","source_cn":"珀尔修斯……你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3EE1F82FD00392C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510914008:0":{"text":"건방진 원숭이 같으니, 죽음의 순간에도 짐승의 군주님께 무례를 범하다니!","source_cn":"不识好歹的猿人。死到临头，还敢对兽群之主不敬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD95D72DF4439917A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510914009:1":{"text":"아쿠보르를 침략했던 그날부터, 너희는 오늘의 업보를 예상했어야 했다!","source_cn":"从侵略雅库伯尔的第一天起，你们早该想到今日的报应！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2F7C469604EC3B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510914010:0":{"text":"용맹한 전사들이여, 두려워 마라! 아쿠보르의 달께서 우리를 가호하고 계신다!","source_cn":"英勇的战士，不要畏惧！雅库伯尔之月正庇佑着我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE6FA2E307E3723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510914011:1":{"text":"가라! 보칼리스인을 모조리 죽여 목숨을 잃은 동족의 원수를 갚고, 굴욕을 씻자!!","source_cn":"上！杀光呼临人！为死去的